 127:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0: 0 bits for preemption priority
 128:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    4 bits for subpriority
